# Build context is the repo root for every image (each needs the root lockfile and libs/shared).
# Keep it small and free of secrets: everything listed here never reaches the Docker daemon.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/src/generated
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs
deploy/k8s
*.log
